{"3957720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grim Pastures: Outlaws", "steam_appid": 3957720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/ea99547a8d2ca4d96e9fdb39ed424fb0.poster.avif?t=1762801429\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/ea99547a8d2ca4d96e9fdb39ed424fb0.webm?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/ea99547a8d2ca4d96e9fdb39ed424fb0.mp4?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Survival Story Where Trust Is Tested</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grim Pastures: Outlaws</strong> is a multiplayer social deduction survival game set on a nostalgic 1970s farm. Each player becomes a seasonal worker, but danger hides within the group: killers lurk among the innocents, ready to strike. Survival depends on your wits and instincts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/805605a3725a5e8b8e3b9ef9da7804f5.poster.avif?t=1762801429\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/805605a3725a5e8b8e3b9ef9da7804f5.webm?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/805605a3725a5e8b8e3b9ef9da7804f5.mp4?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Are an Innocent</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all farm orders and load the wagons to keep the farm running.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work carefully and stay alert to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose whom to trust wisely; misplaced trust may cost you your life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes by surviving and exposing the killers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/41725000a684092f126d66beb61c2a3a.poster.avif?t=1762801429\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/41725000a684092f126d66beb61c2a3a.webm?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/41725000a684092f126d66beb61c2a3a.mp4?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Are a Killer</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in with the innocents and earn their trust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage tasks and strike when the moment is right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pretend to help to avoid suspicion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate voting to shift blame onto others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/9ead1abe895fc893a3f94f7c350c27ea.poster.avif?t=1762801429\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/9ead1abe895fc893a3f94f7c350c27ea.webm?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/9ead1abe895fc893a3f94f7c350c27ea.mp4?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Voting System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something feels wrong, <strong>ring the bell</strong> or <strong>report a dead body</strong>. The entire farm gathers to discuss who the killer might be. The player who receives the most votes is sent to the gallows. Make your decisions carefully, one wrong choice can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/5cfa6666da8a186dc368c9a5565b7908.poster.avif?t=1762801429\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/5cfa6666da8a186dc368c9a5565b7908.webm?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/5cfa6666da8a186dc368c9a5565b7908.mp4?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters and Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player controls a unique character, each with special abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapper</strong> – Can set traps that catch and kill others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undertaker</strong> – Reveals the role of fallen players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional</strong> – Can kill without leaving a body behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Copycat</strong> – Appears like a killer but is actually innocent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outlaw</strong> – Innocent but can use weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And many more</strong> – Each character adds variety and strategy to every match.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/ea99547a8d2ca4d96e9fdb39ed424fb0.poster.avif?t=1762801429\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/ea99547a8d2ca4d96e9fdb39ed424fb0.webm?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/ea99547a8d2ca4d96e9fdb39ed424fb0.mp4?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Survival Story Where Trust Is Tested</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grim Pastures: Outlaws</strong> is a multiplayer social deduction survival game set on a nostalgic 1970s farm. Each player becomes a seasonal worker, but danger hides within the group: killers lurk among the innocents, ready to strike. Survival depends on your wits and instincts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/805605a3725a5e8b8e3b9ef9da7804f5.poster.avif?t=1762801429\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/805605a3725a5e8b8e3b9ef9da7804f5.webm?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/805605a3725a5e8b8e3b9ef9da7804f5.mp4?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Are an Innocent</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all farm orders and load the wagons to keep the farm running.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work carefully and stay alert to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose whom to trust wisely; misplaced trust may cost you your life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes by surviving and exposing the killers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/41725000a684092f126d66beb61c2a3a.poster.avif?t=1762801429\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/41725000a684092f126d66beb61c2a3a.webm?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/41725000a684092f126d66beb61c2a3a.mp4?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Are a Killer</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in with the innocents and earn their trust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage tasks and strike when the moment is right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pretend to help to avoid suspicion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate voting to shift blame onto others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/9ead1abe895fc893a3f94f7c350c27ea.poster.avif?t=1762801429\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/9ead1abe895fc893a3f94f7c350c27ea.webm?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/9ead1abe895fc893a3f94f7c350c27ea.mp4?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Voting System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something feels wrong, <strong>ring the bell</strong> or <strong>report a dead body</strong>. The entire farm gathers to discuss who the killer might be. The player who receives the most votes is sent to the gallows. Make your decisions carefully, one wrong choice can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/5cfa6666da8a186dc368c9a5565b7908.poster.avif?t=1762801429\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/5cfa6666da8a186dc368c9a5565b7908.webm?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/extras/5cfa6666da8a186dc368c9a5565b7908.mp4?t=1762801429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters and Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player controls a unique character, each with special abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapper</strong> – Can set traps that catch and kill others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undertaker</strong> – Reveals the role of fallen players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional</strong> – Can kill without leaving a body behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Copycat</strong> – Appears like a killer but is actually innocent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outlaw</strong> – Innocent but can use weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And many more</strong> – Each character adds variety and strategy to every match.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Grim Pastures: Outlaws is a multiplayer social deduction game for up to 12 players. Innocents work to fulfill the farm’s orders, while killers secretly sabotage the process. In a voting situation, one player is sent to the gallows. In a farm where trust doesn’t exist, who will you believe?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Bulgarian, Indonesian, Dutch, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Hungarian, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Czech, Swedish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/a014187d4766e9d66bfc23b392b10d1bff00a679/header.jpg?t=1762801429", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/b49881f932c81489474e34ef4215217afb944c71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762801429", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/b49881f932c81489474e34ef4215217afb944c71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762801429", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6300 / Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1400 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": [" 7hgamestudio"], "publishers": [" 7hgamestudio"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 299, "final": 299, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$2.99"}, "packages": [1389934], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Grim Pastures: Outlaws", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1389934, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Grim Pastures: Outlaws - $2.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_d